{"id":344171,"date":"2018-06-25T17:44:32","date_gmt":"2018-06-26T00:44:32","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/?p=344171"},"modified":"2018-06-25T17:44:32","modified_gmt":"2018-06-26T00:44:32","slug":"south-napa-earthquake-linked-to-summer-groundwater-dip","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/2018\/06\/25\/south-napa-earthquake-linked-to-summer-groundwater-dip\/","title":{"rendered":"South Napa Earthquake linked to summer groundwater dip"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Recently there were a number of news articles released on the August 24, 2014 South Napa earthquake.\u00a0 Below are a number of links to these articles.\u00a0 The CCRA thanks Meredith Kraner, a graduate student at the University of Nevada, Reno, and lead author of the new study for her work and links.<\/p>\n<p>This is AGU&#8217;s report. The most detailed and accurate.<br \/>\n<a class=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https:\/\/blogs.agu.org\/geospace\/2018\/06\/12\/south-napa-earthquake-linked-to-summer-groundwater-dip\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/blogs.agu.org\/geospace\/2018\/06\/12\/south-napa-earthquake-linked-to-summer-groundwater-dip\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>This is AP news<br \/>\n<a class=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https:\/\/apnews.com\/ef3a2a7eccfc43189b8b8728bf0f8a2f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/apnews.com\/ef3a2a7eccfc43189b8b8728bf0f8a2f<\/a><\/p>\n<p>This is KQED<br \/>\n<a class=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kqed.org\/science\/1925744\/study-2014-napa-quake-may-be-linked-to-groundwater-changes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/www.kqed.org\/science\/1925744\/study-2014-napa-quake-may-be-linked-to-groundwater-changes<\/a><\/p>\n<p>This is CBS SF<br \/>\n<a class=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/sanfrancisco.cbslocal.com\/2018\/06\/13\/earthquake-weather-2014-south-napa-quake\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http:\/\/sanfrancisco.cbslocal.com\/2018\/06\/13\/earthquake-weather-2014-south-napa-quake\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>This is CBS SF radio. They did a good job, in my opinion.<br \/>\n<a class=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https:\/\/kcbsradio.radio.com\/media\/audio-channel\/scientists-summer-earthquake-season-napa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/kcbsradio.radio.com\/media\/audio-channel\/scientists-summer-earthquake-season-napa<\/a><\/p>\n<p>This is ABC news<br \/>\n<a class=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/abc7news.com\/weather\/2014-napa-quake-may-be-linked-to-groundwater-changes\/3599438\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http:\/\/abc7news.com\/weather\/2014-napa-quake-may-be-linked-to-groundwater-changes\/3599438\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>This is NBC news<br \/>\n<a class=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https:\/\/www.nbcbayarea.com\/news\/local\/2014-Napa-Quake-May-Be-Linked-to-Groundwater-Changes-Study-485441671.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/www.nbcbayarea.com\/news\/local\/2014-Napa-Quake-May-Be-Linked-to-Groundwater-Changes-Study-485441671.html<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Here was the CBS LA report that messed up. I am sorry, but drought and heat were not the findings of my study.<br \/>\n<a class=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https:\/\/losangeles.cbslocal.com\/2018\/06\/14\/earthquake-weather-study\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/losangeles.cbslocal.com\/2018\/06\/14\/earthquake-weather-study\/<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Recently there were a number of news articles released on the August 24, 2014 South Napa earthquake.\u00a0 Below are a number of links to these articles.\u00a0 The CCRA thanks Meredith <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"http:\/\/ccra.us\/2018\/06\/25\/south-napa-earthquake-linked-to-summer-groundwater-dip\/\">Continue Reading &rarr;<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_jetp